# The speed ability is "whenever one or more opponents lose life during your turn" (CR 702.179d), and a player has it only
# once they have speed. Bot1 Bolts Bot2 before Perilous Snare is out: no speed, nothing triggers (and nothing is used up
# of "only once each turn"). The Snare gives speed 1 (CR 704.5aa); Bot1 paying 2 life for Gitaxian Probe triggers
# nothing, since Bot1 is no opponent of Bot1. A second Bolt at Bot2 then raises the speed to 2: the earlier losses
# neither counted nor spent the turn's one triggering.

